  "title": "ensure_ascii controls non-ASCII escaping",
  "summary": "When json.dumps uses ensure_ascii=false, non-ASCII characters can appear directly in its output.",
  "content": {
    "statement": "Setting ensure_ascii to false in json.dumps allows non-ASCII characters to remain unescaped in the returned text.",
